      "title": "doc: Stress that call tvb_reported_length_remaining avoids overflow",
      "message": "doc: Stress that call tvb_reported_length_remaining avoids overflow\n\nIn the section on overflow in README.developer, add a comment that\nit's safer to call tvb_reported_length_remaining each time you want\nto check if there is length left than to call it once early on and\ndecrement it. The latter leads to possible overflow; the API function\nchecks for overflow.\n",
